<title>USA: Cargill unit cuts C.R. Anthony stake.</title>
<headline>Cargill unit cuts C.R. Anthony stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargill Financial Servicers Corp, a unit of commodities processor and marketer Cargill Inc, said Monday it reduced its stake in C.R. Anthony Co to 9.857 percent or 890,648 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cargill Financial said it sold 204,624 shares of C.R. Anthony between August 4 and December 13. It did not state how much it sold the shares.</p>
<p>C.R. Anthony is an Oklahoma City, Okla.,-based clothing retail chain.</p>
